[xUnit.net 00:01:25.22]                               default:&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:01:25.22]                                   // The following allows us to arbitrarily delay the loading of WebAssembly resources.&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:01:25.22]                                   // This is useful for guaranteeing that auto mode components will fall back on&#xD;
